      "type": "text",
      "value": "An ammonia ice plant operates on simple saturation cycle at the following 17 temperatures."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Condensing temperatures 40°C"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Evaporating temperatures -20°C"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "It produces 10 tons of ice per day at -5°C from water at $3 0 ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C }$ . Determine:"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(i) Capacity of the refrigeration plant,"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(ii) Mass flow rate of refrigeration,"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(iii) Isentropic discharge temperature, and"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(iv) Theoretical and actual COP."
